0..75 Comment "//! This site hosts the migration model\'s far world. The host secret of the"
76..112 Comment "//! two-process test proves its key."
113..116 Comment "//!"
117..195 Comment "//! A site is one place that a world runs at. The site file names the key that"
196..273 Comment "//! the world proves and the sockets that reach it. So the place stays out of"
274..354 Comment "//! the program and out of the flags. The secret stays outside the model source."
355..358 Comment "//!"
359..437 Comment "//! `gandr host --site` binds these sockets in place of `--net-bind`. The host"
438..513 Comment "//! proves the key with the secret that this site names. `GANDR_SECRET_FAR`"
514..589 Comment "//! holds the secret, or the model that `--secrets` names. The site answers"
590..646 Comment "//! nothing. The program\'s `far` requires nothing of it."
647..650 Comment "//!"
651..692 Comment "//! - see: `two-processes.manifold.gandr`"
